ator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"贵耳集","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"宋史/卷474#.E9.9F.93.E4.BE.82.E8.83.84","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7474#.E9.9F.93.E4.BE.82.E8.83.84","origin":"sister-template","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:03.386Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:jinshi","source:songshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:jinshi-8489d08868041aef","query":"韓侂冑","count":1,"offset":9961,"excerpt":"熈載來報嗣位。\n戊午，遣東北路招討使溫迪罕速可等使宋賀即位。閏月庚辰，宋遣沈揆、韓侂冑來賀登位。\n六月乙卯，勑有司移報宋天壽節。\n七月辛巳，遣刑部尚書完顏守貞等為賀宋生辰使。\n八月丙辰，宋遣禮部尚書謝深甫、觀察使趙昂賀天壽節。\n十一月辛酉，遣右宣","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","query":"韓侂冑","count":5,"offset":1800,"excerpt":"八月辛未，遣吏部尚書吳鼎樞等為賀宋生辰使。\n己卯，宋試吏部尚書汪義端、福州觀察使韓侂冑賀天壽節。\n十一月丙申，遣刑部尚書紇石烈貞等為賀宋正旦使。|| 正月丁亥朔，夏武節大夫王彥才、宣德郎高大節賀正旦。\n三月丙申，夏御史大夫李彥崇、知中興府事郝庭俊","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-0dcb5d3fe6f22b0f","query":"韓侂冑","count":5,"offset":13795,"excerpt":"樞密院事。　四月甲辰，許及之罷知樞密院事。\n\n1205　開禧元年乙丑　七月辛酉，韓侂冑自太師、永興軍節度使、充萬壽觀使、平原郡王拜平章軍國事。 陳自強 韓侂冑　　四月戊子，劉德秀自吏部尚書除端明殿學士、簽書樞密院事。戊戌，錢象祖自同知樞密院事除參","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-e17d5d75fca43ae8","query":"韓侂冑","count":1,"offset":7279,"excerpt":"其能。願令本州少假借，責之練習，期以歲月，考績用成否，上於朝而黜陟之。」上嘉納。韓侂冑方用事，族有居越者，私釀公行，作賓逮捕置於獄，而竄其奴。又論紹興府和買事，語在《食貨志》。\n\n除兩浙轉運副使。入對，奏：「攢宮一司，歲拔經、總制錢為緡率四萬有奇","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-1c7aa0306297f753","query":"韓侂冑","count":6,"offset":3143,"excerpt":"刑獄。以太常少卿召，改祕書監兼實錄院檢討官，權禮部侍郎、太常寺。\n\n太廟芝草生，韓侂冑率百官觀焉，異謂其色白，慮生兵妖，侂冑不悅。又以劉光祖於異交密，言者遂以異在言路不彈丞相留正及受趙汝愚薦，劾罷之，久乃予祠。起知夔州兼本路安撫。異以夔民土狹食少","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:jinshi-8489d08868041aef","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷61","title":"金史/卷61","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B761","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432654","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B761?action=history","revisionId":2432654,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:39:11Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:02.247Z","sha256":"78ae99e54666953b267fc921bf3c9014626985131fd6a22fba03fb298b51d0cb","textSha256":"140ba333481d5f1702ec7108a23c016f9b2d9fcd6579114cad4867d0f5bee136","expandedWikitextSha256":"78ae99e54666953b267fc921bf3c9014626985131fd6a22fba03fb298b51d0cb","characters":10350,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshi.json","status":"incomplete","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.208Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"has-unresolved-material","extractionNotes":["含圖片或特殊字形；檔名、圖說或字形標記已保留，但影像內容尚未轉為文字，不能視為純文字完整。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/93dd9385fa053366fcc2.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/93dd9385fa053366fcc2.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷62","title":"金史/卷62","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E